00:28:46.870 --> 00:28:50.210
But I promise you that The Office is at the top, top, tippy top.

607
00:28:50.770 --> 00:28:53.210
You know, people love that show so much.

608
00:28:53.370 --> 00:28:55.210
They love the dinner party episode.

609
00:28:55.210 --> 00:28:59.210
I mean, a lot of people have called and gotten interviews with me.

610
00:28:59.310 --> 00:29:06.410
And, you know, Rolling Stone picking it as the top comedic episode in the first 10 years of this century or something.

611
00:29:06.690 --> 00:29:07.690
I know y'all know all this.

612
00:29:07.790 --> 00:29:10.850
But it is extremely popular show.

613
00:29:10.970 --> 00:29:12.730
Y'all are much, much beloved.

614
00:29:13.070 --> 00:29:14.110
I mean, you truly are.

615
00:29:14.250 --> 00:29:16.830
And I know for a fact, because you're not around.

616
00:29:17.150 --> 00:29:20.430
They have no reason to tell me how much they love you.

617
00:29:20.430 --> 00:29:21.390
And they do.

618
00:29:21.550 --> 00:29:22.170
They just do.

619
00:29:22.650 --> 00:29:26.390
Well, we were so lucky to have you on The Office.

620
00:29:26.390 --> 00:29:30.190
And we're so lucky that you joined us today to talk about speed.

